      <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-text paragraph--view-mode--default">
      <div class="text-text">
                    <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><h2>Contact details for tuition fees</h2>
<p>If you have any further questions related to tuition fees and scholarships, please send a message to <a href="mailto:tuitionfees@aalto.fi">tuitionfees@aalto.fi</a>.</p>
<p>You can also book a meeting with your school's tuition fee specialist via the <a href="https://mystudies.aalto.fi/">MyStudies platform</a>, if you cannot find answers to your questions and want to go through them together with someone. <a href="/en/node/383266">Instructions for using MyStudies</a>.</p></div>
